{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18104380","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18104380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1810438001:1":{"text":"이런 곳에도 단서가...","source_cn":"这里竟然有线索……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x255CF059F9ED2CFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1810438001":{"text":"이런 곳에도 단서가...","source_cn":"这里竟然有线索……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x255CF059F9ED2CFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810438002:1":{"text":"습관이다. 나와 바든이 자주 쓰던 연락 방식이었거든.","source_cn":"习惯。这是我和巴登以前惯用的传信方式之一。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6FC556DF7AE623C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810438003:1":{"text":"제가 아는 바든이라면... 설령 에리스, 당신을 “낯선 사람”으로 여겼다 해도 분명 당신의 안전을 걱정했을 겁니다.","source_cn":"以我对他的了解，他必然会挂念你的安危，哪怕你只是个“陌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77920790587D3BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810438004:1":{"text":"그러니 무사히 빠져나갈 수 있도록, 안전한 퇴로를 알려주는 단서를 남겨두었겠지요.","source_cn":"他肯定会留下线索，让你有条安全的退路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84F26B1F0CF7136B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810438005:1":{"text":"바든은 원래 그런 사람입니다. 부상자를 절대 포기하지 않고 끝까지 책임지려고 하는, 그런 사람...","source_cn":"他就是这样的烂好人。他不会放弃任何伤者的性命，一定会对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4E4F6A81B73389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810438006:1":{"text":"하지만 이건 바든 오빠의 글씨체가 아니잖아!","source_cn":"但是纸条上的字迹不是他的呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD7CB8EFFE2FC560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810438007:1":{"text":"아니요. 오히려 이 쪽지는 <style=\"highlight\">레인이 바든이라는 것을 증명하고 있습니다</style>.","source_cn":"不，这进一步佐证，<style=highlight>里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF783EF1465719840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810438008:1":{"text":"바든은 비밀 편지를 보낼 때 왼손으로 글씨를 씁니다. 지금 이 “레인”의 필체와 똑같지요.","source_cn":"巴登只有在传密信时会用左手写字，字迹和里纳的留言一模一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E1B93A01633E7EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810438009:1":{"text":"황혼빛 마을로 가죠. 위치는...","source_cn":"去夕染村见他吧。位置是在——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FFCA5ADEF394C64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","do